  "title": "U.S.-Saudi Nuclear Deal and Geopolitical Tensions",
  "summary": "The U.S.-Saudi nuclear deal, as announced by President Trump, hinges on Israel's recognition, creating tensions and complicating the relationship between the two nations. The deal aims to provide access to Saudi nuclear energy programs, but its success remains uncertain.",
